h cutting-edge technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The official sequel to </strong><i>Alive</i> – the legendary Amiga shoot 'em up returns!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 or 2 players</strong> – team up or go solo!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five action-packed levels</strong> filled with non-stop shooting madness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A deadly arsenal</strong> of weapons, power-ups… and power-downs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colossal end-of-level bosses</strong> that will test your skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gorgeous pixel-perfect graphics</strong> with fluid animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Insanely addictive gameplay</strong> that keeps you coming back</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original soundtrack</strong> to amp up the adrenaline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exclusive sound effects</strong> by the legendary <strong>Allister Brimble</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hordes of relentless enemies</strong> ready to challenge you</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exclusive physical edition!</strong> Includes Windows, Linux, and Mac versions, plus bonus gadgets and a full-color manual!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to take on the challenge?</p>", "short_description": "Relive the thrill of ‘90s arcade mayhem in this modern take on classic coin-op action! Featuring stunning high-resolution graphics and a pulse-pounding soundtrack, this game delivers old-school intensity with cutting-edge technology.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758360/6add64a3fe14a8237a8216f1d78cd9d980afcf99/header.jpg?t=1759298371", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto